{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15851","headline":"越中送王使君赴江华 · 崔峒","name":"越中送王使君赴江华","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"皂盖春风自越溪，独寻芳树桂阳西。\n远水浮云随马去，空山弱筱向云低。\n遥知异政荆门北，旧许新诗康乐齐。\n万里相思在何处，九疑残雪白猿啼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔峒","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15851.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15851","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}